  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Earth Platform Initiative - Pre-project and PoC (KnowIT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a pre-project that will lay the foundation for the development of a holistic digital architecture for climate adaptation, food security and nature/biodiversity (Open Earth Platform Initiative - OpenEPI). It is an innovation project that aims to demonstrate how the use of open climate and environmental data and algorithms can improve developing countries&apos; ability to adapt to climate change and how open and accessible digital infrastructure and services can support this. Project work includes the development of prototypes and case-studies, as well as define the direction for a full-scale project. The case-studies are focused on a few countries in Sub-Saharan Africa. The project has a gender focus both in workshops/meetings and in development of prototypes and case-studies.</narrative>
  </description>
